  m_text: "HOW TO BUILD A BAND\n\nYou're the lead guitarist. Build your band and
    try to survive\n\nMove\nDesktop: \u2190 / \u2192 to move, Space to jump\nMobile:
    Dragrag to move, drag up to jump\n\nAvoid obstacles and shoot and destroy enemies
    before they reach you.\nGrow your band.\nPass through gates to gain members.
    Each type powers you up:\n\nDrummer -> faster shooting\nBassist -> stronger hits\nRhythm
    Guitarist -> more bullets\nKeyboardist -> longer range\n"
